  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against Fang Yuan, Qi Zai frowns as the fight turns against him and begins a counterattack with this battlefield killer move. Fang Yuan is not nervous. The move is only mortal level and has little threat toward Gu Immortals who have Immortal Gu. Only a rank six Gu Immortal without Immortal Gu would feel it as a huge threat. Fang Yuan already has this kind of battlefield killer move. He answers with Xue Song Zi’s battlefield killer move snow domain. Qi lockdown is pushed aside as coldness seeps into the air, and the battlefield splits into an icy domain and a stretch of motionless air.",
